  "details": "Every time I login to VRChat, my Avatar is completely reset back to default. \n\ni have made sure the parameters are saved between worlds when uploaded. \n\nThe avatar does not reset when i change worlds. it only resets when I Close VRChat and then get back on, even the avatar resize has been Reset each time. \n\nI have made multiple projects, and every upload is the same. it even broke one of my previous avatars. I know its not the parameters since they are all synced and saved. plus the fact that the avatar Height is also resetted which is in the quick actions menu. \n\nbeen losing my mind that this is only happening to the one specific model which is the Dergodal from Nicoreda, and even they have no idea whats going on. \n\nso far it seems that I'm the only person with this particular issue, all i can see is VRChat isn't saving the data of that particular Avatar no matter what ID its under and i have no clue what to do to fix this.",
